{"2104280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TIKTOKI: RACING", "steam_appid": 2104280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIKTOKI: RACING is a focused precision driving challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One car. One island route. One objective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small, deliberate release built around the feel of a single lap. No career mode, no championships, no inflated feature list. Just a car, a road, and the time you set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island began years ago as a mod map and has been rebuilt here as a high-fidelity driving environment. It is not a backdrop for content. It is the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single handcrafted island route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One car tuned for focused time trial driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal best chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fixed driving environment for repeatable runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stripped-back experience built around improvement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIKTOKI: RACING is not trying to be every racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is one lap, made with care.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIKTOKI: RACING is a focused precision driving challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One car. One island route. One objective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small, deliberate release built around the feel of a single lap. No career mode, no championships, no inflated feature list. Just a car, a road, and the time you set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island began years ago as a mod map and has been rebuilt here as a high-fidelity driving environment. It is not a backdrop for content. It is the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Get</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single handcrafted island route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One car tuned for focused time trial driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal best chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fixed driving environment for repeatable runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stripped-back experience built around improvement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIKTOKI: RACING is not trying to be every racing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is one lap, made with care.</p>", "short_description": "A focused precision driving challenge. One car. One island track. One objective: beat your own time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104280/70324d8c2895621a2a30c003fbb6ca938a0a44ab/header.jpg?t=1782461643", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104280/0064a6fa03710038cbda88ad9b38160d3904839f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782461643", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104280/0064a6fa03710038cbda88ad9b38160d3904839f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782461643", "website": "https://tiktoki.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br